{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 3873464,
  "courseSlug": "nextjs-react-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Next.js & React - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "43341186",
      "title": "Switching Auth Modes With Query Parameters (Search Params)",
      "lectureOrder": 218,
      "videoOrder": 204,
      "sourceHash": "65a98b40dcac792457e79a5ae264078981837fd902e572d453b3c62bf160c345",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.51,
          "end": 1.83,
          "en": "So let's now make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.83,
          "end": 5.55,
          "en": "that users can actually also log into our application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.55,
          "end": 9.24,
          "en": "and not just create new accounts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.24,
          "end": 11.85,
          "en": "For that, we first of all must make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.85,
          "end": 16.85,
          "en": "that we can switch from signup to login mode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.28,
          "end": 19.89,
          "en": "so that users can click this button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.89,
          "end": 21.09,
          "en": "this link here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.09,
          "end": 23.61,
          "en": "and they then stay on this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.61,
          "end": 27.15,
          "en": "But we somehow change the mode behind the scenes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.15,
          "end": 29.7,
          "en": "so that when the form is submitted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.7,
          "end": 33.81,
          "en": "we actually don't trigger the signup action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.81,
          "end": 36.15,
          "en": "as we currently always do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.15,
          "end": 39.36,
          "en": "but that we instead either trigger that action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.36,
          "end": 41.55,
          "en": "or the login action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.55,
          "end": 44.49,
          "en": "which we have yet to add to this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.49,
          "end": 47.913,
          "en": "depending on which mode the user selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.87,
          "end": 52.14,
          "en": "And therefore, let's start by switching that mode",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.14,
          "end": 56.1,
          "en": "when that button or that link here is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.1,
          "end": 59.43,
          "en": "And there would be different ways of handling this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.43,
          "end": 60.75,
          "en": "We could, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.75,
          "end": 64.14,
          "en": "use the useState Hook offered by React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.14,
          "end": 67.44,
          "en": "to keep track of some mode state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.44,
          "end": 71.67,
          "en": "that's either login or signup, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.67,
          "end": 73.65,
          "en": "And we could then change that mode",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.65,
          "end": 76.533,
          "en": "whenever that link below the form is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.46000000000001,
          "end": 80.43,
          "en": "But I'll not use that hook here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.43,
          "end": 83.07,
          "en": "instead, I'll use search params,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.07,
          "end": 86.78999999999999,
          "en": "query params, for managing that mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.78999999999999,
          "end": 90.27,
          "en": "My idea is that when we click that login",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.27,
          "end": 92.28,
          "en": "with existing account link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.28,
          "end": 96.45,
          "en": "I lead to user to the page they're already on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.45,
          "end": 100.863,
          "en": "But I add a query parameter called mode here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.72999999999999,
          "end": 104.043,
          "en": "which I'll set to login.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.24000000000001,
          "end": 106.86,
          "en": "And with Next.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.86,
          "end": 110.7,
          "en": "we can then easily extract any query parameters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.7,
          "end": 113.4,
          "en": "any search parameters that might have been set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.4,
          "end": 115.47,
          "en": "on that page we're currently on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.47,
          "end": 117.72,
          "en": "by using a special prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.72,
          "end": 122.72,
          "en": "that's added to all page components in Next.js applications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.18,
          "end": 127.11,
          "en": "So for that, I'll go to that root page.js file here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.11,
          "end": 128.4,
          "en": "that homepage,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.4,
          "end": 132.21,
          "en": "and there we can use object destructuring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.21,
          "end": 135.843,
          "en": "to get hold of the searchParams prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.16,
          "end": 140.25,
          "en": "That's a special prop that's added automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.25,
          "end": 143.73,
          "en": "to all page components in Next.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.73,
          "end": 145.5,
          "en": "and it will contain an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.5,
          "end": 149.22,
          "en": "that has one key for any query parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.22,
          "end": 152.583,
          "en": "that might've been set on the currently active URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.48,
          "end": 156.99,
          "en": "So if I redirect a user to the currently active page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.99,
          "end": 161.34,
          "en": "with a mode query parameters set to login,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.34,
          "end": 164.28,
          "en": "there will be a mode property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 164.28,
          "end": 166.44299999999998,
          "en": "on that searchParams object here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 167.31,
          "end": 169.53,
          "en": "So I can get my formMode",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 169.53,
          "end": 171.36,
          "en": "or however we wanna call it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 171.36,
          "end": 176.28,
          "en": "by accessing searchParams.mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.28,
          "end": 179.01,
          "en": "Now of course, this might not be set at all",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 179.01,
          "end": 181.83,
          "en": "if no query parameters were added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 181.83,
          "end": 186.33,
          "en": "and therefore, I'll add an initial state of login here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 186.33,
          "end": 189.09,
          "en": "So formMode is login",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 189.09,
          "end": 192.033,
          "en": "if searchParams.mode doesn't have a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 193.41,
          "end": 196.2,
          "en": "Now we can pass this through a prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 196.2,
          "end": 199.353,
          "en": "that could be called mode to the AuthForm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 200.932,
          "end": 202.68,
          "en": "And in the AuthForm,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 202.68,
          "end": 204.9,
          "en": "we can, and should therefore accept",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 204.9,
          "end": 207.75,
          "en": "and destructure a prop called mode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 207.75,
          "end": 212.46,
          "en": "which will be a string with the word login or signup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 212.46,
          "end": 213.603,
          "en": "That's the plan.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 215.57999999999998,
          "end": 218.13,
          "en": "So we can now use this mode prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 218.13,
          "end": 220.95,
          "en": "which will contain such a string down here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 220.95,
          "end": 223.953,
          "en": "and check if mode is login.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 224.88,
          "end": 229.88,
          "en": "In which case, I actually wanna render a different link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 230.55,
          "end": 234.03300000000002,
          "en": "that says create an account.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 235.68,
          "end": 237.51,
          "en": "Because if the mode is login,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 237.51,
          "end": 239.49,
          "en": "I want to offer the user a link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 239.49,
          "end": 243.93,
          "en": "to go to the account creation mode instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 243.93,
          "end": 246.81,
          "en": "Therefore the query parameter mode should be set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 246.81,
          "end": 248.703,
          "en": "to signup, in that case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 250.89,
          "end": 252.18,
          "en": "On the other hand,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 252.18,
          "end": 254.913,
          "en": "if mode is equal to signup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 256.26,
          "end": 260.01,
          "en": "I want to render that link I had there originally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 260.01,
          "end": 262.863,
          "en": "where I say login with existing account.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 264.72,
          "end": 266.7,
          "en": "So that I got either this link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 266.7,
          "end": 270.24,
          "en": "or this link depending on the mode value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 270.24,
          "end": 273.453,
          "en": "and these links can then be used to switch the mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 274.86,
          "end": 278.13,
          "en": "Now it's not just the links that depend on the modes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 278.13,
          "end": 281.133,
          "en": "instead, it's also the text on this button, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 281.97,
          "end": 286.05,
          "en": "Here we can also check if the mode is login, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 286.05,
          "end": 291.05,
          "en": "In which case, I wanna give the button a caption of Login.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 291.09000000000003,
          "end": 294.24,
          "en": "And otherwise, if it's not login,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 294.24,
          "end": 295.56,
          "en": "if it's signup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 295.56,
          "end": 299.103,
          "en": "it should have a caption of Create Account, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 301.44,
          "end": 304.65,
          "en": "And if you save that all you should be able to reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 304.65,
          "end": 307.35,
          "en": "and if you click on Create an account,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 307.35,
          "end": 309.63,
          "en": "and then on login with existing account,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 309.63,
          "end": 313.17,
          "en": "you should be able to switch between these different modes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 313.17,
          "end": 316.023,
          "en": "And that's now the important first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 317.04,
          "end": 321.42,
          "en": "The next step now is to add a login server action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 321.42,
          "end": 324.54,
          "en": "and to dynamically change that server action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 324.54,
          "end": 326.37,
          "en": "that's assigned to the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 326.37,
          "end": 328.71,
          "en": "or that's assigned to use formState,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 328.71,
          "end": 331.38,
          "en": "to be precise, based on the mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 331.38,
          "end": 333.033,
          "en": "That's what we'll do next.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
